# S-size synthetic dataset for the Library demo ontology.
# Reference date for lifecycle expectations: 2026-09-15.
# Controlled values (lib:AVAILABLE, lib:ON_LOAN, etc.) are defined in library_concept_schemes.ttl.

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# People: every person is either a borrower or an author; the sets are disjoint.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

